---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import { park } from '../data/park';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Public Transport to Lake View Park Islamabad"
  description="Public transport to Lake View Park Islamabad: how to use CDA’s transit map, why no direct bus is guaranteed, and how to plan the return."
  path="/public-transport/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is there a direct bus to Lake View Park?', a: 'Use CDA’s transit map for the route, stop and direction relevant to you, and check the last return departure before you set out.' },
    { q: 'How do I find the right stop?', a: 'Use CDA’s official transit information and pin the Plus Code so your map shows the approach. Public transport in Islamabad changes, so a current official map beats any fixed list.' },
    { q: 'How do I get back in the evening?', a: 'Evening return transport can be scarcer, so confirm your ride before the park gets quiet. You may need to combine a bus with a short taxi or ride-hail for the final stretch.' },
    { q: 'Why doesn’t this page list bus numbers and fares?', a: 'Any specific route, stop, fare or timetable here would be unverified and could mislead. We rely on CDA’s live transit map and on-site signs instead.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Public transport', href: '/public-transport/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'How to get there', href: '/how-to-get-there/' },
    { label: 'Taxi & ride-hailing', href: '/taxi-ride-hailing/' },
    { label: 'From central Islamabad', href: '/from-islamabad-city/' },
    { label: 'Parking', href: '/parking/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">This page helps you reach Lake View Park without a car, using CDA’s current transit map to plan the route and final walk.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Start with CDA’s transit map</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Use <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="https://www.cda.gov.pk/cdaTransitMap" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CDA’s transit information ↗</a> to find the actual route, stop and direction relevant to your start point. Public transport in Islamabad changes, so a current official map beats any fixed list.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">No guaranteed direct service</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Assume you may need to combine a ride with a short walk, taxi or ride-hail for the final stretch, and check the last return departure before you set out.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Plan the final walk and return</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Pin the destination with the Plus Code <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1">{park.plusCode}</code> so your map shows the approach. Because evening return transport can be scarcer, confirm your ride before the park gets quiet.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#b3261e] bg-[#fdecea] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#b3261e]">Do not trust invented schedules</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#7a1c16]">Any specific bus number, stop name, fare or departure time here would be unverified. Rely on CDA’s live transit map and on-site signs instead.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Build a flexible route</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Without a guaranteed direct service, plan to combine a bus or metro leg with a short walk, taxi or ride-hail for the final stretch to the gate. Confirm the return option before you set out so you aren’t stranded in the evening.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Check CDA’s transit map for your actual route and stop.',
      'Pin the Plus Code so your map shows the approach.',
      'Don’t trust invented bus numbers, fares or timetables.',
      'Arrange your evening return before the park gets quiet.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
